# models/readiness/
#
# Artifacts created in Phase 6 (Readiness Engine):
#   readiness_weights.json        — component weights and scoring thresholds
#   readiness_band_thresholds.json — score-to-band mapping (Ready / Moderately Ready / etc.)
#
# The Readiness Engine is rule-based weighted scoring — no .joblib model artifact.
# Config JSONs are stored here for runtime loading and easy tuning.
